URL: https://github.com/NixOS/patchelf/releases/download/0.19.3/patchelf-0.19.3.tar.bz2 b0131371208a7b68c3d172c77025a692cf56e7c118929ca77df68db7ba8a3ff8
Origname: patchelf-0.19.3
Name: patchelf

    patchelf 0.19.3 with no Fil-C changes needed. The 0.18.0 Fil-C patch
    rewrote the .shstrtab pointer to be derived as
    fileContents->data() + rdi(shdrs[shstrtabIndex].sh_offset) instead of
    round-tripping a pointer through size_t, which Fil-C cannot do
    safely; upstream 0.19.1 restructured that code to the same
    capability-safe shape (data() + shstrtabOffset), and 0.19.2 and
    0.19.3 keep that shape, so the patch is empty and the rebase needed
    no conflict resolution.
